{"id":"justa","lemma":"justa","pos":"noun","rank":2899,"glosses":["tournament","joust","jousting (often in the plural)"],"ipa":"/ˈxusta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"justas"},"order":2904,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-justa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Fue una lucha justa.","en":"It was a fair fight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448879","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"fight, fighting, fray"},null]},{"text":"Creo que la decisión es justa.","en":"I believe that the decision is just.","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"decision"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"La ley no siempre es justa.","en":"The law isn't always fair.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"law"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}